<%# LP notification: NDA has been updated to a new version, re-acceptance required. %>
<%# Sent to all InvestorAccess users of investors with stale acceptances. %>

<p>The NDA for a Data Room folder you previously accepted has been updated. You will need to re-accept the new NDA to maintain access.</p>

<table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold">Folder</td>
    <td style="padding:6px 12px"><%= @folder_name %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<% if @folder_link.present? %>
  <p style="margin-top:16px">
    <a href="<%= @folder_link %>" style="color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none">Re-accept NDA →</a>
  </p>
<% end %>
